  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: A12_8
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "We spawn in Aleph\u2019s room again. We directly head out wearing cloaks
      to stay inconspicuous."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We search for clues, anything that could lead us to that other timeline.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But all we could find, were more people like John, people with dark auras
      who can probably all wield the same dark magic as John.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "They are not the souls of the real people. Either they have eliminated
      and replaced the souls of those people, or they got rid of them and shape shifted,
      so that they would look like them. It\u2019s best if we don\u2019t cross paths
      with them."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 96ec51593b93df042857171a2e8b311a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5f6b079910c6f7f41a7fb288ef4963f7, type: 2}
